# Every path, by default. A public repo accepts PRs from anyone, and this
# checkout is what a Hive-provisioned machine loads into every pi session — so a
# merge here reaches a fleet of workstations within one timer cycle. Review is
# not a formality on that path.
*                       @Artifex-org/core-team

# Tighter still: these decide what a session may reach, or run before anything
# else does. A change here is a change to a security boundary.
/extensions/web/        @Artifex-org/core-team
/extensions/guards-common/  @Artifex-org/core-team
/extensions/hive-common/    @Artifex-org/core-team
/extensions/hive-remote/    @Artifex-org/core-team
/extensions/claude-oauth/   @Artifex-org/core-team
/workstation/           @Artifex-org/core-team
/.github/               @Artifex-org/core-team
